://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/46) provides the reusable validation component, open/unmerged with 41 offline tests and both GitHub checks passing. Existing native comparisons reproduced the unchanged positive/clean Cobrapy reference and Scanpy’s prerequisite failure, with verified archival/cleanup. Main still exposes prompt inspection pending review.\n\n**Fresh generation:** #45 now exercised official generation → audited local export → ordinary validation automatically. One fresh package for already known Cobrapy PR #1497 cost **$0.287646 across 11 upstream model calls**. The unchanged clean rebuild failed before controls because its saved APT install follows a prelude that deletes package indexes. Both primary archives have anonymous HF readback; generation cleanup is verified, validator cleanup is finishing. No task/grade repair or regeneration. [Findings](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/blob/7759bb06/experiments/45-generation-handoff/results.md). A freshly generated portable task with independent passing controls remains unproven; recipe fidelity is next.\n\n**Coverage:** original #28 totals remain 83 exports, 82 ever-positive and 67 ever-clean. Twenty-five exports are publicly eligible; 58 Matchms exports remain withheld. The fresh #1497 reproduction is a separate package instance of a known PR, not an additional unique task. Keep follow-up controls and historical totals separate.\n\n**Budget:** last reconciled allocation 8.779887/32 CPUh, with 0.333333 CPUh reserved for validator stop/cleanup. Provider actual $0.287646; existing $10 archival reservation unreconciled. No active model reservation/admission or new paid capacity. Operating ceiling $90, strictly below $100 extra. Update terminal cleanup accounting in the next evidence comment.\n\nKeep #28 closed and this epic/children open for review. Concise status lives here; detailed logs, append-only HF receipts and follow-ups live in comments/subissues. Retain protected evidence and research branches. No automatic PR merge or dataset release.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}